        "answer": {
          "short": "Missing entries by row: $0, 3$; $8, -10$; $-5$. Magic sum: $-3$.",
          "worked": "The complete diagonal gives the magic sum:\n$$\\begin{align*}-6+(-1)+4&=-3\\end{align*}$$\nBottom-left entry:\n$$\\begin{align*}-3-(-2)-4&=-3+2-4\\\\&=-5\\end{align*}$$\nMiddle-left entry:\n$$\\begin{align*}-3-(-6)-(-5)&=-3+6+5\\\\&=8\\end{align*}$$\nMiddle-right entry:\n$$\\begin{align*}-3-8-(-1)&=-3-8+1\\\\&=-10\\end{align*}$$\nTop-middle entry:\n$$\\begin{align*}-3-(-1)-(-2)&=-3+1+2\\\\&=0\\end{align*}$$\nTop-right entry:\n$$\\begin{align*}-3-(-6)-0&=-3+6\\\\&=3\\end{align*}$$\nEvery row, column and diagonal sums to $-3$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
